.TH SENTINEL 8 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.0" "System Daemons"
.SH NAME
sentinel \- IDS watch plus IPS exterminate
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sentinel
.RI [ \-\-once | learn ]
.RB ( started by systemd; drive it with
.BR ali-sentinel (1))
.SH DESCRIPTION
Watches brute-force logins (auto-firewalls at 5 fails), new
listening ports, deleted-binary and known-bad processes, and
watched system files. Alerts via desktop ping, feed
.RI ( /run/ali-security )
and log. Baselines self-create on first boot;
.B learn
re-trusts the present.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ali-sentinel (1),
.BR oracle (8)
